OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGTHREE HUNDRED DEAD AFTER
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGTURKISH EXPLOSION
OL,4,D
OL,5, Officials in Turkey have said about 300
OL,6, people have died in the country's worst
OL,7, ever pit disaster.
OL,9,FRescue workers have abandoned hope for
OL,10,F200 coal miners still trapped below
OL,11,Fground; around 95 bodies have been
OL,12,Fbrought to the surface.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FAbout 700 miners were under ground when
OL,15,Fmethane gas explosions hit the
OL,16,FIncirharmani mine under the Black Sea
OL,17,Ftown of Kozlu on Tuesday.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FPrime Minjster Suleyman Demirel said
OL,20,Fthe whole nation was mourning.
OL,21,F
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG04-03-92
OL,23,D] FMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
